'''First Round (Deadly)''' is the third and final stage in [[The Proving Grounds]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[2nd Round: Dawn (Deadly)]]
*[[2nd Round: Dusk (Deadly)]]

